    card title Yesterday

A: What did you do yesterday? So far you have был, была́ and пил, пила́.
    draw speakers o_was

A: Now every verb you know gets a past. Listen to Masha and me.
    highlight o_was effect underline color #c9871a

    erase o_was

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: I asked что ты де́лал: де́лал is did, from де́лать.
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #c9871a part де́лал

A: And I said я рабо́тал, I worked, from рабо́тать. Both end in л.
    highlight talk_2_words effect underline color #c9871a part рабо́тал

    draw talk

B: I read and I watched: чита́ла, смотре́ла. The same л, and then an а.
    highlight talk_3_words effect underline color #c9871a part чита́ла

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Masha and her brother together: смотре́ли, with и. Л, ла, ли: you've heard that before.
    highlight talk_5_words effect underline color #c9871a part смотре́ли

    erase talk

    hide speakers

B: In lesson eighteen, быть became был, была́, бы́ло, бы́ли, and пить became пил, пила́.
    draw byt byt_g

A: Almost every verb does the same. Take чита́ть, to read.
    draw chit chit_g

    highlight chit effect underline color #c9871a part ть

A: Drop the ть and add л: он чита́л.
    draw br_m

A: For she, add а: она́ чита́ла; for more than one, и: они́ чита́ли.
    draw br_f br_p

    erase pageB

A: Now the good news. The present had six endings.
    draw c_now

B: The past has just three endings for people, plus ло for an оно́ word, as in бы́ло.
    draw c_neut

B: A man says я чита́л, ты чита́л, он чита́л.
    draw cr_m

A: A woman: я чита́ла, ты чита́ла, она́ чита́ла.
    draw cr_f

B: And мы, вы and они́ all take ли, even polite вы for one person.
    draw cr_p

A: So the past never asks which person: only he, she, it, or more than one.
    highlight cv_m cv_f cv_p effect underline color #c9871a

    erase pageC

A: Every verb from lesson twenty-two works the same: знал, понима́л, де́лал, рабо́тал.
    draw d_easy

B: Жить has a в in the present: я живу́.
    draw d_zhit d_zhit_n

B: But the past starts from жить: жил, and она́ жила́.
    highlight d_zhit effect underline color #c9871a

A: Люби́ть: the extra л of люблю́ is gone, and the и stays: люби́л.
    draw d_lub d_lub_n

B: Смотре́ть gives смотре́л, and говори́ть, говори́л: whatever stands before the ть stays.
    draw d_smo d_gov

A: So start from the dictionary form, not from я; the present's quirks stay behind.
    highlight d_zhit d_lub d_smo d_gov effect underline color #c9871a

    erase pageD

B: Only идти́ breaks the rule. In lesson twenty-seven, Tom said я иду́ на рабо́ту.
    draw e_tom e_now e_now_g

A: Yesterday, я шёл на рабо́ту: I was walking to work.
    draw e_past e_past_g

A: Nothing like идти́: the stem changes completely. But the л is still there.
    highlight e_past effect underline color #c9871a part шёл

B: For a woman, шла; for more than one, шли: the same л, ла, ли.
    draw e_forms e_forms_g

    erase pageE

    draw q1

    quiz "Masha says what she did: Вчера́ я ___ кни́гу. Which fits?" reveal.text "Вчера́ я чита́ла кни́гу." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Masha is a woman, so her я takes ла.
        wrong: Who is speaking: a man or a woman?
        * чита́л
        + чита́ла
        * чита́ли

    erase q1

    draw q2

    ask "Tom says he worked yesterday. Type the missing word: Вчера́ я ___." answer ["рабо́тал","работал"] reveal.text "Вчера́ я рабо́тал." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Рабо́тать, take off the ть, add л: a man says я рабо́тал.
        wrong: Start from рабо́тать: drop the ть, then what?

    erase q2

    draw q3

    quiz "Masha and Ivan watched a film together. Masha says: Мы ___ фильм. Which fits?" reveal.text "Мы смотре́ли фильм." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Two of them, so ли, whoever they are.
        wrong: How many people watched?
        * смотре́л
        * смотре́ла
        + смотре́ли

    erase q3

    draw q4

    quiz "Mum lived in Moscow: Ма́ма ___ в Москве́. Which fits?" reveal.text "Ма́ма жила́ в Москве́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: From жить, not from живу́: жил, and for mum, жила́.
        wrong: Start from the dictionary form, жить, not from я живу́.
        * живла́
        + жила́
        * живёт

    erase q4

    group q5 members ["q5_t","q5_m","q5_ask"]

    quiz "Now Tom asks Masha: Ма́ша, что ты ___ вчера́? Which fits?" reveal.text "Что ты де́лала вчера́?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ты is Masha here, a woman, so де́лала, whoever asks.
        wrong: Who is ты here: Tom, or Masha?
        * де́лал
        + де́лала
        * де́лали

    erase q5

    text s_sum "чита́ть → чита́л · чита́ла · чита́ли" #3d3833 say "читать. читал, читала, читали" colors {"ть$":"#8f887c","л$":"#2f6b8f","а$":"#b5482e","и$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 620 font_size 52
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase s_sum

A: So for yesterday: take the dictionary form, drop the ть, and add л.
    text end_rule "-ть → -л · -ла · -ло · -ли" #3d3833 colors {"ть$":"#8f887c","о$":"#8a5fa8","л$":"#2f6b8f","а$":"#b5482e","и$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 470 font_size 66

A: Then end it like был: nothing, а, о, or и.
    text end_rule_g "he · she · it · more than one" #8f887c x 500 y 375 font_size 46

    erase end_rule end_rule_g

B: Вчера́ я чита́ла и смотре́ла фильм.
    icon e_masha size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text e_s1 "Вчера́ я чита́ла и смотре́ла фильм." #3d3833 say "Вчера я читала и смотрела фильм." say_voice b x 500 y 420 font_size 48

B: А что вы де́лали вчера́? Пока́!
    text e_s2 "А что вы де́лали вчера́? Пока́!" #3d3833 say "А что вы делали вчера? Пока!" say_voice b x 500 y 340 font_size 48
    text e_g "Yesterday I read and watched a film. And what did you do? Bye!" #8f887c x 500 y 270 font_size 28

